{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"04c28a3e-9df4-4493-ab85-add920210235","ts":"2026-07-16T10:38:17.241-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"57","nodeName":"Google Gemini Chat Model","workflowName":"ForgeAI - Research Agent","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini","workflowId":"HzreqcZjzzEN49Ui","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are the Research Agent of ForgeAI.\\n\\nYour responsibility is to perform product and market research for the software project received from the Planner Agent.\\n\\nYou DO NOT write code.\\n\\nAnalyze the project idea and provide:\\n\\n- Existing competitors\\n- Similar products\\n- Market demand\\n- Target audience\\n- Monetization strategies\\n- Technical risks\\n- Business risks\\n- MVP features\\n\\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"competitors\\\": [],\\n  \\\"market_analysis\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"target_audience\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"monetization\\\": [],\\n  \\\"technical_risks\\\": [],\\n  \\\"business_risks\\\": [],\\n  \\\"mvp_features\\\": []\\n}\\n\\nDo not use markdown.\\nDo not explain anything.\\nReturn only JSON.\\nHuman: ={\\\"output\\\":\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"project_name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"AI Resume Screening Platform\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"project_type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"AI/SaaS Platform\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"business_goal\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Automate and optimize the initial resume screening process for recruiters, reducing time-to-hire and improving candidate quality through AI-driven matching and scoring.\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"complexity\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"High\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"required_agents\\\\\\\":[\\\\n      \\\\\\\"Product Manager\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"UX/UI Designer\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"Frontend Developer\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"Backend Developer\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"AI/ML Engineer\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"DevOps Engineer\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"QA Engineer\\\\\\\"\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"deliverables\\\\\\\":[\\\\n      \\\\\\\"Detailed Product Requirements Document (PRD)\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"UX/UI Design Mockups and Prototypes\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"Resume Parsing and Data Extraction Module (AI)\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"Job Description Analysis Module (AI)\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"Candidate Matching and Scoring Engine (AI)\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"User Authentication and Authorization System\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"Resume Upload and Management Interface\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"Recruiter Dashboard with Analytics and Reporting\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"Scalable Backend API\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"Deployment Infrastructure\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"Comprehensive Test Suite\\\\\\\"\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"recommended_stack\\\\\\\":{\\\\n      \\\\\\\"frontend\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"React\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"backend\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Python (FastAPI)\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"database\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"PostgreSQL\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"deployment\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"AWS (ECS/EKS, S3, RDS, SageMaker)\\\\\\\"\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\"}\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\",\"temperature\":0.2},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"competitors\\\": [\\n    \\\"Workday (with AI features)\\\",\\n    \\\"Greenhouse (with AI features)\\\",\\n    \\\"Lever (with AI features)\\\",\\n    \\\"SmartRecruiters (with AI features)\\\",\\n    \\\"Eightfold.ai\\\",\\n    \\\"SeekOut\\\",\\n    \\\"HireVue (AI-powered video interviewing and assessments)\\\",\\n    \\\"Pymetrics (gamified assessments and AI matching)\\\",\\n    \\\"Paradox (conversational AI for recruiting)\\\",\\n    \\\"Harver (pre-employment assessments and AI matching)\\\",\\n    \\\"Beamery (Talent CRM with AI capabilities)\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"market_analysis\\\": \\\"The global recruitment software market is substantial and growing, driven by the need for efficiency, cost reduction, and improved candidate quality. Recruiters face challenges with high application volumes, time-consuming manual screening, and unconscious bias. AI-powered resume screening addresses these pain points by automating initial screening, enhancing matching accuracy, reducing time-to-hire, and promoting skills-based hiring. There's a strong demand from mid-sized to large enterprises and recruitment agencies looking to streamline their talent acquisition processes. The market is competitive, with established ATS providers integrating AI and specialized AI recruitment platforms emerging. Differentiation will be key, focusing on accuracy, bias mitigation, user experience, and seamless integration with existing HR tech stacks. Regulatory scrutiny around AI in hiring (e.g., bias audits) is an emerging factor influencing market adoption and product development.\\\",\\n  \\\"target_audience\\\": \\\"HR departments and talent acquisition teams in mid-sized to large enterprises, recruitment agencies, and companies with high-volume hiring needs across various industries (e.g., technology, healthcare, retail, manufacturing). The primary users will be recruiters and hiring managers seeking to optimize their initial candidate screening process.\\\",\\n  \\\"monetization\\\": [\\n    \\\"SaaS Subscription Model: Tiered pricing based on features, number of active job postings, number of candidate screenings per month, or number of user seats.\\\",\\n    \\\"Enterprise Licensing: Custom pricing for large organizations requiring specific integrations, dedicated support, or advanced analytics.\\\",\\n    \\\"Value-added Services: Offering premium features like advanced analytics, custom AI model training, or integration services for an additional fee.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"technical_risks\\\": [\\n    \\\"AI Model Accuracy and Performance: Ensuring high precision and recall for resume parsing, job description analysis, and candidate matching across diverse industries and resume formats. Inaccurate matches or missed qualified candidates can undermine trust.\\\",\\n    \\\"Bias in AI Models: Risk of AI models inheriting and amplifying biases present in training data, leading to discriminatory outcomes. Requires robust bias detection, mitigation strategies, and continuous monitoring.\\\",\\n    \\\"Data Privacy and Security: Handling sensitive personal data from resumes requires strict adherence to data protection regulations (GDPR, CCPA, etc.) and robust security measures to prevent breaches.\\\",\\n    \\\"Scalability: Designing the platform to efficiently process and store large volumes of resumes and job descriptions, and to handle concurrent screening requests as user base grows.\\\",\\n    \\\"Integration Complexity: Seamlessly integrating with various existing Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS) and Human Resources Information Systems (HRIS) used by clients can be challenging.\\\",\\n    \\\"Natural Language Processing (NLP) Challenges: Accurately extracting and interpreting nuanced information from unstructured text in resumes and job descriptions, including synonyms, acronyms, and industry-specific jargon.\\\",\\n    \\\"Maintenance and Updates: Continuously updating AI models to reflect evolving job market trends, new skills, and changing language patterns to maintain relevance and accuracy.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"business_risks\\\": [\\n    \\\"Market Competition: The recruitment technology space is highly competitive with established ATS providers integrating AI features and numerous specialized AI recruitment startups.\\\",\\n    \\\"Adoption Resistance: Potential skepticism or resistance from recruiters and HR professionals who may fear job displacement, lack of human touch, or distrust AI's capabilities.\\\",\\n    \\\"Ethical and Regulatory Concerns: Increasing scrutiny and evolving regulations around AI use in hiring (e.g., laws requiring AI bias audits) could impact market acceptance and require continuous compliance efforts.\\\",\\n    \\\"Data Quality Dependency: The effectiveness of the platform heavily relies on the quality and completeness of the input data (resumes, job descriptions) provided by users.\\\",\\n    \\\"Sales and Marketing Challenges: Educating the market on the unique value proposition and differentiating the platform from competitors will require significant marketing efforts.\\\",\\n    \\\"Pricing Strategy: Finding the optimal pricing model that attracts customers while ensuring profitability and perceived value in a competitive market.\\\",\\n    \\\"Reputational Risk: Negative publicity related to AI bias, data breaches, or poor performance could severely damage the brand and hinder adoption.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"mvp_features\\\": [\\n    \\\"User Authentication and Authorization (Recruiter Accounts)\\\",\\n    \\\"Resume Upload (Single and Batch) and Basic Parsing (Extracting key fields like skills, experience, education)\\\",\\n    \\\"Job Description Input (Manual entry or upload of JD text)\\\",\\n    \\\"Basic Candidate Matching and Scoring Engine (AI-driven relevance score based on JD and resume)\\\",\\n    \\\"Candidate Profile View (Display parsed resume data and match score for each candidate)\\\",\\n    \\\"Basic Filtering and Sorting of Candidates (By score, keywords, date)\\\",\\n    \\\"Recruiter Dashboard (Overview of active jobs, application count, top matched candidates)\\\",\\n    \\\"Feedback Mechanism (Recruiters can mark candidates as 'good fit'/'bad fit' to provide feedback for AI improvement)\\\",\\n    \\\"Basic Reporting (e.g., number of screened candidates, average match score)\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":1159,\"promptTokens\":501,\"totalTokens\":1660}}}"}}
