{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"73b88a98-1d17-4b23-b948-5356b76b59f2","ts":"2026-07-16T10:46:45.413-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"61","nodeName":"Google Gemini Chat Model","workflowName":"ForgeAI - Research Agent","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini","workflowId":"HzreqcZjzzEN49Ui","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are the Research Agent of ForgeAI.\\n\\nYour responsibility is to perform product and market research for the software project received from the Planner Agent.\\n\\nYou DO NOT write code.\\n\\nAnalyze the project idea and provide:\\n\\n- Existing competitors\\n- Similar products\\n- Market demand\\n- Target audience\\n- Monetization strategies\\n- Technical risks\\n- Business risks\\n- MVP features\\n\\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"competitors\\\": [],\\n  \\\"market_analysis\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"target_audience\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"monetization\\\": [],\\n  \\\"technical_risks\\\": [],\\n  \\\"business_risks\\\": [],\\n  \\\"mvp_features\\\": []\\n}\\n\\nDo not use markdown.\\nDo not explain anything.\\nReturn only JSON.\\nHuman: ={\\\"output\\\":\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"project_name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AI Resume Screening Platform\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"project_type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"SaaS Platform Development (AI/ML)\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"business_goal\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Streamline and automate the initial resume screening process for recruiters, significantly reducing manual effort, improving candidate quality, and accelerating time-to-hire through AI-powered matching and analysis.\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"complexity\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"High\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"required_agents\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Product Manager\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"UI/UX Designer\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Frontend Developer\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Backend Developer\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"AI/ML Engineer (NLP Specialist)\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Data Engineer\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"DevOps Engineer\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"QA Engineer\\\\\\\"\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"deliverables\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Detailed Product Requirements Document (PRD)\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Comprehensive UI/UX Design (Wireframes, Mockups, Prototypes)\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Interactive Web Application (Frontend)\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Robust Backend API Services\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"AI/ML Models for Resume Parsing, Skill Extraction, Semantic Matching, and Candidate Ranking\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Scalable Database Schema and Implementation\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Automated Deployment Pipeline (CI/CD)\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Comprehensive Test Suite and QA Reports\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"User and Admin Documentation\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Initial set of pre-trained models for common industries/roles\\\\\\\"\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"recommended_stack\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"frontend\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"React.js / Next.js\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"backend\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Python (FastAPI for APIs, Django for admin/ORM)\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"database\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostgreSQL (for structured data), Elasticsearch (for search/indexing)\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"deployment\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AWS (EKS/ECS for containers, S3 for storage, RDS for DB, SageMaker for ML ops, Lambda for serverless functions)\\\\\\\"\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\"}\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\",\"temperature\":0.2},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\\"competitors\\\": [\\\"HireVue\\\", \\\"Talentegy\\\", \\\"Textkernel\\\", \\\"Beamery (partially)\\\", \\\"Eightfold.ai\\\", \\\"Paradox AI\\\", \\\"Pymetrics\\\", \\\"Workday (with AI modules)\\\", \\\"Greenhouse (with integrations)\\\", \\\"SmartRecruiters (with integrations)\\\"],\\n\\\"market_analysis\\\": \\\"The market for AI-powered recruitment solutions is experiencing significant growth, driven by the increasing volume of job applications, the need for efficiency in hiring, and the desire to reduce bias. Companies are actively seeking tools to automate repetitive tasks like initial resume screening, allowing recruiters to focus on high-value activities. There's a strong demand for solutions that can accurately match candidates to job requirements, extract key skills, and provide data-driven insights to accelerate time-to-hire and improve candidate quality. The global HR tech market is expanding, with AI/ML being a key innovation driver, indicating a robust and receptive market for such a platform.\\\",\\n\\\"target_audience\\\": \\\"Human Resources departments, Talent Acquisition teams, Recruiters (corporate and agency), Staffing firms, Hiring Managers, Enterprise-level organizations with high volume hiring needs, Small to Medium Businesses (SMBs) looking to optimize their recruitment process without large internal teams.\\\",\\n\\\"monetization\\\": [\\\"Subscription-based tiers (e.g., Basic, Pro, Enterprise) based on features, number of users, or volume of resumes processed per month/year.\\\", \\\"Per-resume processing fee for ad-hoc usage or overage charges.\\\", \\\"Custom enterprise solutions with dedicated support and integrations.\\\", \\\"Value-added services such as advanced analytics, bias detection reports, or integration with existing ATS/HRIS systems.\\\", \\\"Freemium model with limited features or resume processing capacity, encouraging upgrade to paid tiers.\\\"],\\n\\\"technical_risks\\\": [\\\"Accuracy and bias in AI/ML models: Ensuring the models accurately parse resumes, extract relevant information, and match candidates without introducing or amplifying existing biases (e.g., gender, race, age). Requires extensive training data and continuous monitoring.\\\", \\\"Data quality and volume for AI training: Obtaining sufficient, diverse, and high-quality resume and job description data to train robust and generalizable AI models.\\\", \\\"Scalability of AI inference: Processing a large volume of resumes in real-time or near real-time as the user base grows.\\\", \\\"Integration complexity: Seamlessly integrating with various Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS) and Human Resources Information Systems (HRIS) used by clients.\\\", \\\"Security and privacy of sensitive candidate data: Protecting personal information on resumes and ensuring compliance with regulations like GDPR, CCPA.\\\", \\\"Performance of NLP models: Ensuring efficient and accurate parsing of diverse resume formats and unstructured text.\\\", \\\"Infrastructure cost management for AI/ML operations.\\\"],\\n\\\"business_risks\\\": [\\\"Market competition: Facing established players and new startups in the HR tech space.\\\", \\\"Data privacy and compliance: Navigating complex and evolving data privacy regulations globally (GDPR, CCPA, etc.) and building trust with users regarding sensitive candidate data.\\\", \\\"Client adoption and change management: Convincing HR teams to adopt new technology and integrate it into their existing workflows.\\\", \\\"Perception of 'AI replacing humans': Overcoming resistance from recruiters who might view AI as a threat rather than an assistant.\\\", \\\"Bias accusations: Potential for negative publicity or legal challenges if the AI is perceived to be biased in its screening.\\\", \\\"Pricing strategy: Finding the right balance to attract customers while ensuring profitability.\\\", \\\"Reliance on third-party integrations: Dependence on APIs and data formats of other HR systems.\\\"],\\n\\\"mvp_features\\\": [\\\"User authentication and authorization (recruiter/admin roles).\\\", \\\"Job description parsing and creation (manual input or upload).\\\", \\\"Resume upload functionality (single and bulk).\\\", \\\"Basic resume parsing and key information extraction (skills, experience, education).\\\", \\\"AI-powered matching of resumes to job descriptions with a relevance score.\\\", \\\"Candidate ranking based on matching score.\\\", \\\"Simple candidate profile view with extracted information.\\\", \\\"Search and filter capabilities for screened candidates.\\\", \\\"Dashboard for recruiters to view active jobs and candidate pipelines.\\\", \\\"Feedback mechanism for AI model improvement (e.g., 'thumbs up/down' on matches).\\\"]}\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":862,\"promptTokens\":586,\"totalTokens\":1448}}}"}}
