{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"8499cea7-d4a7-4c48-b2e0-fa25ca6f05d8","ts":"2026-07-16T10:47:40.148-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"63","nodeName":"Google Gemini Chat Model","workflowName":"ForgeAI - Software Architect Agent","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini","workflowId":"GtMVKU0V13n1DZOO","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are the Software Architect Agent of ForgeAI.\\n\\nYou are a Senior Software Architect with 15+ years of experience.\\n\\nYou never write implementation code.\\n\\nYou receive the outputs from the Planner Agent and Research Agent.\\n\\nYour responsibility is to design the complete technical architecture.\\n\\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"architecture_type\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"frontend_architecture\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"backend_architecture\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"database_design\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"api_design\\\":[\\n  ],\\n  \\\"folder_structure\\\":[\\n  ],\\n  \\\"microservices\\\":[\\n  ],\\n  \\\"authentication\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"deployment_architecture\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"scalability_plan\\\":\\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"security_considerations\\\":[\\n  ]\\n}\\n\\nReturn only JSON.\\n\\nDo not explain anything.\\n\\nDo not use markdown.\\nHuman: ={}\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\",\"temperature\":0.2},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"architecture_type\\\": \\\"Microservices Architecture\\\",\\n  \\\"frontend_architecture\\\": \\\"Single Page Application (SPA) using React.js with Redux for state management. Modular component-based structure, Webpack for bundling, and Babel for transpilation.\\\",\\n  \\\"backend_architecture\\\": \\\"Microservices-based architecture, each service developed using Node.js (Express.js) or Python (FastAPI/Django REST Framework). Services communicate via RESTful APIs or asynchronous messaging (e.g., Kafka/RabbitMQ). API Gateway (e.g., Ocelot, Kong, AWS API Gateway) for routing, load balancing, and authentication.\\\",\\n  \\\"database_design\\\": \\\"Polyglot Persistence: PostgreSQL for core relational data (e.g., user profiles, orders). MongoDB for flexible, document-based data (e.g., logs, user activity feeds). Redis for caching and session management. Each microservice owns its data store.\\\",\\n  \\\"api_design\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"User Service API\\\",\\n      \\\"endpoints\\\": [\\n        {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/users\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Retrieve all users\\\"},\\n        {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/users/{id}\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Retrieve user by ID\\\"},\\n        {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/users\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Create a new user\\\"},\\n        {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/users/{id}\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"PUT\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Update user by ID\\\"},\\n        {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/users/{id}\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"DELETE\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Delete user by ID\\\"}\\n      ],\\n      \\\"authentication\\\": \\\"JWT required\\\",\\n      \\\"rate_limiting\\\": true\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Product Service API\\\",\\n      \\\"endpoints\\\": [\\n        {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/products\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Retrieve all products\\\"},\\n        {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/products/{id}\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Retrieve product by ID\\\"},\\n        {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/products\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Create a new product\\\"},\\n        {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/products/{id}\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"PUT\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Update product by ID\\\"}\\n      ],\\n      \\\"authentication\\\": \\\"JWT required for POST/PUT\\\",\\n      \\\"rate_limiting\\\": true\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Order Service API\\\",\\n      \\\"endpoints\\\": [\\n        {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/orders\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Retrieve all orders\\\"},\\n        {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/orders/{id}\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"GET\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Retrieve order by ID\\\"},\\n        {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/orders\\\", \\\"method\\\": \\\"POST\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Create a new order\\\"}\\n      ],\\n      \\\"authentication\\\": \\\"JWT required\\\",\\n      \\\"rate_limiting\\\": true\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"folder_structure\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"root\\\",\\n      \\\"children\\\": [\\n        {\\\"name\\\": \\\"frontend/\\\", \\\"children\\\": [\\\"src/\\\", \\\"public/\\\", \\\"package.json\\\"]},\\n        {\\\"name\\\": \\\"backend/\\\", \\\"children\\\": [\\n          {\\\"name\\\": \\\"api-gateway/\\\", \\\"children\\\": [\\\"src/\\\", \\\"package.json\\\"]},\\n          {\\\"name\\\": \\\"user-service/\\\", \\\"children\\\": [\\\"src/\\\", \\\"package.json\\\", \\\"Dockerfile\\\"]},\\n          {\\\"name\\\": \\\"product-service/\\\", \\\"children\\\": [\\\"src/\\\", \\\"package.json\\\", \\\"Dockerfile\\\"]},\\n          {\\\"name\\\": \\\"order-service/\\\", \\\"children\\\": [\\\"src/\\\", \\\"package.json\\\", \\\"Dockerfile\\\"]}\\n        ]},\\n        {\\\"name\\\": \\\"infrastructure/\\\", \\\"children\\\": [\\\"kubernetes/\\\", \\\"terraform/\\\", \\\"docker-compose.yml\\\"]},\\n        {\\\"name\\\": \\\"docs/\\\", \\\"children\\\": [\\\"api-spec/\\\", \\\"architecture/\\\"]},\\n        {\\\"name\\\": \\\"shared/\\\", \\\"children\\\": [\\\"libs/\\\", \\\"types/\\\"]}\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"microservices\\\": [\\n    {\\\"name\\\": \\\"User Service\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Manages user authentication, authorization, and profile data.\\\"},\\n    {\\\"name\\\": \\\"Product Service\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Manages product catalog, inventory, and pricing.\\\"},\\n    {\\\"name\\\": \\\"Order Service\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Handles order creation, processing, and status updates.\\\"},\\n    {\\\"name\\\": \\\"Payment Service\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Integrates with payment gateways and manages transactions.\\\"},\\n    {\\\"name\\\": \\\"Notification Service\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Sends emails, SMS, and push notifications.\\\"},\\n    {\\\"name\\\": \\\"API Gateway\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Entry point for all client requests, handles routing, authentication, and rate limiting.\\\"}\\n  ],\\n  \\\"authentication\\\": \\\"JWT (JSON Web Token) based authentication. Users authenticate with the User Service, which issues a JWT. This token is then sent with subsequent requests to the API Gateway, which validates it and forwards the request to the appropriate microservice. OAuth2 for third-party integrations.\\\",\\n  \\\"deployment_architecture\\\": \\\"Cloud-native deployment on Kubernetes (EKS, GKE, AKS). Microservices are containerized using Docker. CI/CD pipelines (e.g., GitLab CI/CD, GitHub Actions, Jenkins) automate build, test, and deployment. Infrastructure as Code (IaC) using Terraform for provisioning cloud resources. Load balancers (e.g., NGINX Ingress Controller, cloud provider's ALB/ELB) distribute traffic.\\\",\\n  \\\"scalability_plan\\\": \\\"Horizontal scaling for all microservices by adding more instances based on load. Auto-scaling groups in Kubernetes. Database sharding and replication for data scalability and high availability. Caching layer (Redis) to reduce database load. Asynchronous communication (Kafka/RabbitMQ) for decoupling services and handling spikes. Content Delivery Network (CDN) for static assets.\\\",\\n  \\\"security_considerations\\\": [\\n    \\\"Input validation and sanitization to prevent injection attacks (SQL, XSS).\\\",\\n    \\\"HTTPS/TLS for all communication to encrypt data in transit.\\\",\\n    \\\"JWT-based authentication with refresh tokens and secure storage.\\\",\\n    \\\"Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) for fine-grained authorization.\\\",\\n    \\\"API Gateway for centralized authentication, rate limiting, and DDoS protection.\\\",\\n    \\\"Regular security audits and vulnerability scanning.\\\",\\n    \\\"Least privilege principle for service accounts and database access.\\\",\\n    \\\"Environment variables and secrets management (e.g., Kubernetes Secrets, AWS Secrets Manager).\\\",\\n    \\\"Cross-Origin Resource Sharing (CORS) policies configured correctly.\\\",\\n    \\\"Logging and monitoring for suspicious activities and security incidents.\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":1412,\"promptTokens\":175,\"totalTokens\":1587}}}"}}
