{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"8b69f72b-447d-4345-b8e2-15ad6033ceaf","ts":"2026-07-16T10:50:44.707-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"67","nodeName":"Google Gemini Chat Model","workflowName":"ForgeAI - Research Agent","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini","workflowId":"HzreqcZjzzEN49Ui","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are the Research Agent of ForgeAI.\\n\\nYour responsibility is to perform product and market research for the software project received from the Planner Agent.\\n\\nYou DO NOT write code.\\n\\nAnalyze the project idea and provide:\\n\\n- Existing competitors\\n- Similar products\\n- Market demand\\n- Target audience\\n- Monetization strategies\\n- Technical risks\\n- Business risks\\n- MVP features\\n\\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"competitors\\\": [],\\n  \\\"market_analysis\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"target_audience\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"monetization\\\": [],\\n  \\\"technical_risks\\\": [],\\n  \\\"business_risks\\\": [],\\n  \\\"mvp_features\\\": []\\n}\\n\\nDo not use markdown.\\nDo not explain anything.\\nReturn only JSON.\\nHuman: ={\\\"output\\\":\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"project_name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AI Resume Screening Platform\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"project_type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"SaaS Application\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"business_goal\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Automate and optimize the initial resume screening process for recruiters and hiring managers, reducing time-to-hire and improving candidate quality.\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"complexity\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"High\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"required_agents\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Product Manager\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"UI/UX Designer\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Frontend Developer\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Backend Developer\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"AI/ML Engineer\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"DevOps Engineer\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"QA Engineer\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Data Scientist\\\\\\\"\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"deliverables\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Web-based platform for job posting and resume submission\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"AI-powered resume parser (extracts skills, experience, education)\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Skill and experience matching engine against job descriptions\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Candidate scoring and ranking system\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"User dashboard for recruiters (manage jobs, candidates, view analytics)\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"API for integration with existing ATS (Applicant Tracking Systems)\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Reporting and analytics module on screening efficiency\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Secure data storage and privacy compliance features\\\\\\\"\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"recommended_stack\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"frontend\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"React\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"backend\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Python (FastAPI)\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"database\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostgreSQL\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"deployment\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AWS (ECS/EKS, S3, Lambda, SageMaker)\\\\\\\"\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\"}\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\",\"temperature\":0.2},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"competitors\\\": [\\n    \\\"Greenhouse\\\",\\n    \\\"Workday (with AI features)\\\",\\n    \\\"SAP SuccessFactors (with AI features)\\\",\\n    \\\"Lever\\\",\\n    \\\"SmartRecruiters\\\",\\n    \\\"HireVue (for video interviews, but also has screening capabilities)\\\",\\n    \\\"Textkernel\\\",\\n    \\\"Sovren\\\",\\n    \\\"Beamery\\\",\\n    \\\"Eightfold.ai\\\",\\n    \\\"Paradox.ai\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"market_analysis\\\": \\\"The market for AI-powered recruitment tools is rapidly growing, driven by the need for efficiency, reduced time-to-hire, and mitigation of unconscious bias in the hiring process. Companies are facing increasing volumes of applications, making manual screening unsustainable and prone to human error. There is a strong demand for solutions that can accurately parse resumes, match candidates to job requirements, and provide data-driven insights. Integration with existing Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS) is crucial for adoption. While many large ATS providers are integrating AI features, dedicated, specialized AI screening platforms can offer deeper functionality and better accuracy, appealing to companies seeking best-of-breed solutions or those with legacy ATS lacking advanced AI.\\\",\\n  \\\"target_audience\\\": \\\"Recruitment agencies, corporate HR departments (especially mid-to-large enterprises), talent acquisition teams, hiring managers, and companies with high-volume hiring needs across various industries.\\\",\\n  \\\"monetization\\\": [\\n    \\\"Subscription-based SaaS model with tiered pricing (e.g., based on number of active job postings, number of candidates screened per month, or number of user seats).\\\",\\n    \\\"Enterprise plans offering custom features, dedicated support, and advanced integrations with existing HR tech stacks.\\\",\\n    \\\"Per-screening fee for specific advanced AI analyses or premium features.\\\",\\n    \\\"Freemium model with limited features or usage, encouraging upgrade to paid plans.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"technical_risks\\\": [\\n    \\\"Accuracy and bias of AI models: Ensuring the AI parser and matching engine are highly accurate and free from inherent biases present in training data, which could lead to discriminatory outcomes.\\\",\\n    \\\"Scalability: Handling large volumes of resume submissions and processing efficiently, especially during peak hiring periods.\\\",\\n    \\\"Integration complexity: Developing robust and flexible APIs to integrate with a wide variety of existing ATS and HRIS systems, each with different data structures and API standards.\\\",\\n    \\\"Data security and privacy: Protecting sensitive candidate data and ensuring compliance with global regulations like GDPR, CCPA, etc.\\\",\\n    \\\"Performance and latency: Ensuring the AI screening process is fast enough to provide real-time or near real-time results without significant delays.\\\",\\n    \\\"Maintaining up-to-date skill taxonomies and industry knowledge for effective matching.\\\",\\n    \\\"Overfitting or underfitting AI models to specific job types or industries.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"business_risks\\\": [\\n    \\\"Market competition: High competition from established ATS providers who are integrating AI, as well as other specialized AI recruitment platforms.\\\",\\n    \\\"Adoption resistance: Potential resistance from recruiters and HR professionals who may be skeptical of AI's capabilities or fear job displacement.\\\",\\n    \\\"Legal and ethical concerns: Risks associated with AI bias leading to legal challenges or reputational damage.\\\",\\n    \\\"Customer acquisition cost: High cost of acquiring customers in a competitive HR tech market.\\\",\\n    \\\"Demonstrating ROI: Difficulty in clearly demonstrating a tangible return on investment for potential clients over existing manual processes or less advanced tools.\\\",\\n    \\\"Data privacy breaches: Any security incident could severely damage trust and reputation.\\\",\\n    \\\"Reliance on data quality: The effectiveness of the platform heavily relies on the quality and completeness of job descriptions and candidate resumes.\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"mvp_features\\\": [\\n    \\\"Basic job posting creation and management (title, description, key requirements).\\\",\\n    \\\"Candidate resume submission portal.\\\",\\n    \\\"Core AI-powered resume parsing (extracting name, contact, education, work experience, skills).\\\",\\n    \\\"Basic skill and keyword matching against job descriptions.\\\",\\n    \\\"Simple candidate scoring and ranking based on matching criteria.\\\",\\n    \\\"Recruiter dashboard for viewing submitted candidates, their scores, and parsed information.\\\",\\n    \\\"Basic filtering and sorting of candidates (e.g., by score, experience level).\\\",\\n    \\\"Secure user authentication and authorization for recruiters.\\\",\\n    \\\"Basic reporting on application volume and top-ranked candidates.\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":924,\"promptTokens\":503,\"totalTokens\":1427}}}"}}
